# Incompatible API changes the API diff gate allows, one per line:
#
#   <module dir><TAB><the line apidiff prints>
#
# The module directory is "." for the root. Each block starts with a comment
# naming the PLAN and step that allow its changes. A release's close-out
# removes its entries: once the next tag is the base, apidiff no longer
# prints them, and scripts/go-apicheck.py fails on them as stale
# (docs/decisions/0014-PLAN-api-policy-gates.md Step 4).

# docs/decisions/0020-PLAN-charm-free-cores-glyphs-and-safetext.md Steps 7 and 8:
# termcap's probe as an I/O-free core, its Bubble Tea host in termcaptea
# (0020-MADR D4, A2). Released in v2.0.0, a major version (A4.2).
.	- ./termcap.Caps.Profile: changed from github.com/charmbracelet/colorprofile.Profile to ColorProfile
.	- ./termcap.KeyboardCaps.Enhancements: removed
.	- ./termcap.KeyboardFlags: removed
.	- ./termcap.NewProber: removed
.	- ./termcap.Prober: removed
.	- ./termcap.Reply.Msg: removed
.	- ./termcap.Reply: old is comparable, new is not
.	- ./termcap.ReportSchemaVersion: value changed from 1 to 2

# docs/decisions/0020-PLAN-charm-free-cores-glyphs-and-safetext.md Step 9:
# termsvc's commands move to termsvctea, over Prepare and PrepareCopy
# (0020-MADR D5, A1.2). Released in v2.0.0, a major version (A4.2).
.	- ./termsvc.(*Notifier).Notify: removed
.	- ./termsvc.(*Notifier).NotifyContext: removed
.	- ./termsvc.(*Notifier).Update: removed
.	- ./termsvc.ActivityBeacon: removed
.	- ./termsvc.Copy: removed
.	- ./termsvc.CopyContext: removed
.	- ./termsvc.LinkPolicy.Open: removed

# docs/decisions/0020-PLAN-charm-free-cores-glyphs-and-safetext.md Step 10:
# command's effects are command.Effect, and its Bubble Tea forms are
# commandtea's (0020-MADR D6, A1.2). Released in v2.0.0, a major version (A4.2).
.	- ./command.(*Registry).Attach: changed from func(func(charm.land/bubbletea/v2.Msg)) func() to func(func(any)) func()
.	- ./command.(*Registry).Dispatch: changed from func(context.Context, Request) charm.land/bubbletea/v2.Cmd to func(context.Context, Request) Effect
.	- ./command.(*Registry).Watch: changed from func() charm.land/bubbletea/v2.Cmd to func(context.Context) Effect
.	- ./command.(*Registry).WatchContext: removed
.	- ./command.LoopMsg.Run: changed from func() charm.land/bubbletea/v2.Cmd to func() Effect
.	- ./command.Result.Cmd: changed from charm.land/bubbletea/v2.Cmd to Effect
.	- ./command.WithLoop: changed from func(func(charm.land/bubbletea/v2.Msg)) RegistryOption to func(func(any)) RegistryOption

# docs/decisions/0020-PLAN-charm-free-cores-glyphs-and-safetext.md Step 12:
# keymap takes termkey's keys, and its Bubble Tea forms are keymaptea's
# (0020-MADR D7, A1.2). Released in v2.0.0, a major version (A4.2).
.	- ./keymap.(*Dispatcher).Explain: changed from func(charm.land/bubbletea/v2.Key, Path, github.com/maccavelli/go-tui-lib/v2/when.Context) Explanation to func(github.com/maccavelli/go-tui-lib/v2/termkey.KeyEvent, Path, github.com/maccavelli/go-tui-lib/v2/when.Context) Explanation
.	- ./keymap.(*Dispatcher).Update: removed
.	- ./keymap.(*Keymap).Help: removed
.	- ./keymap.(*Keymap).KeyBinding: removed
.	- ./keymap.Explanation.Normalized: changed from charm.land/bubbletea/v2.Key to github.com/maccavelli/go-tui-lib/v2/termkey.KeyEvent
.	- ./keymap.Explanation.Raw: changed from charm.land/bubbletea/v2.Key to github.com/maccavelli/go-tui-lib/v2/termkey.KeyEvent
.	- ./keymap.Normalize: changed from func(charm.land/bubbletea/v2.Key, Features, string) (charm.land/bubbletea/v2.Key, bool) to func(github.com/maccavelli/go-tui-lib/v2/termkey.KeyEvent, Features, string) (github.com/maccavelli/go-tui-lib/v2/termkey.KeyEvent, bool)
.	- ./keymap.Outcome.Replay: changed from []charm.land/bubbletea/v2.KeyPressMsg to []github.com/maccavelli/go-tui-lib/v2/termkey.KeyEvent
.	- ./keymap.Settings.Tick: removed
.	- ./keymap.Stroke.BubblesKeys: removed
.	- ./keymap.Stroke.Matches: changed from func(charm.land/bubbletea/v2.Key) bool to func(github.com/maccavelli/go-tui-lib/v2/termkey.KeyEvent) bool
.	- ./keymap.Stroke.Mod: changed from github.com/charmbracelet/ultraviolet.KeyMod to github.com/maccavelli/go-tui-lib/v2/termkey.Mod
